prepared a small gift for you.

343
19:49.440 --> 19:49.940
No, thanks.

344
19:49.940 --> 19:51.140
It's no big deal.

345
19:51.270 --> 19:52.480
Please take it back to Yunyi.

346
19:52.480 --> 19:54.280
It's nothing expensive anyway.

347
19:54.680 --> 19:55.530
So just accept it.

348
19:55.530 --> 19:56.920
Yunyi will be very happy,

349
19:56.920 --> 19:58.520
and she hopes you'll like it.

350
19:59.380 --> 20:00.110
Okay,

351
20:00.110 --> 20:01.840
then please thank Yunyi for me.

352
20:02.180 --> 20:02.920
Well,

353
20:03.130 --> 20:04.420
after I discuss it with Yun Ye,

354
20:04.420 --> 20:06.070
I'll let you know our answer.

355
20:06.510 --> 20:07.570
If there's nothing else,

356
20:07.570 --> 20:08.720
I'll take my leave.

357
20:08.740 --> 20:09.890
Okay, let me give you a ride.

358
20:09.890 --> 20:10.690
Don't bother.

359
20:10.720 --> 20:11.640
My office is just nearby.

360
20:11.640 --> 20:12.720
I can walk back.

361
20:14.220 --> 20:15.010
Okay.

362
20:15.480 --> 20:16.270
Goodbye.

363
20:16.810 --> 20:17.340
Goodbye.

364
21:16.460 --> 21:17.390
I'm in a meeting.

365
21:19.850 --> 21:20.350
Okay.

366
21:40.720 --> 21:42.480
Is he so busy that he doesn't even have time

367
21:42.480 --> 21:43.810
to send an emoji or meme?

368
21:51.530 --> 21:53.980
Will I come across as too clingy?

369
21:55.610 --> 21:57.010
I knew he was busy on a business trip,

370
21:57.010 --> 21:58.740
but I still kept messaging him.

371
21:59.740 --> 22:01.980
What if he needs some personal space?

372
22:02.610 --> 22:04.070
Would he find me annoying?

373
22:16.080 --> 22:16.490
Hello?

374
22:16.890 --> 22:18.320
Hello, Li, what's up?

375
22:18.480 --> 22:19.810
Are Mom and Dad around?

376
22:19.810 --> 22:20.510
No,

377
22:20.510 --> 22:21.680
I'm in my room.

378
22:22.530 --> 22:23.140
Yun Ye,

379
22:23.140 --> 22:24.440
you're no longer a kid!

380
22:24.440 --> 22:26.510
Yet you still need me, your sister, to clean up your mess!

381
22:26.510 --> 22:28.040
What are you talking about?

382
22:28.740 --> 22:29.940
Yunyi's brother

383
22:29.940 --> 22:30.810
saw the postcard

384
22:30.810 --> 22:31.880
you wrote to her,

385
22:31.880 --> 22:33.180
saying you'd come to Nanwu.

386
22:33.180 --> 22:34.420
He plans to come with his sister

387
22:34.420 --> 22:35.480
to meet you.

388
22:35.480 --> 22:36.070
Wait,

389
22:36.090 --> 22:38.370
he said he'd come along?

390
22:38.400 --> 22:40.060
Do you think I made it up?

391
22:41.380 --> 22:42.180
Li,

392
22:42.570 --> 22:45.010
will you join us then?

393
22:46.460 --> 22:47.310
Why would I?

394
22:48.160 --> 22:48.900
Li,

395
22:48.940 --> 22:49.900
could you just

396
22:49.920 --> 22:51.940
help me get her brother out of there?

397
22:52.000 --> 22:54.330
Are you using me as a wingman?

398
22:54.360 --> 22:55.160
I'm not going.

399
22:55.740 --> 22:56.940
I'm begging you, Li!

400
22:56.940 --> 22:58.140
Please just do me this favor.

401
22:58.140 --> 22:59.330
No way. I'm hanging up.

402
22:59.330 --> 23:00.210
Li! Li!

403
23:03.720 --> 23:04.700
This brat...

404
23:22.610 --> 23:23.420
Tangy,

405
23:23.740 --> 23:25.640
remember to put on more layers when you go out.

406
23:25.640 --> 23:27.720
You can catch a cold easily in this weather.

407
23:27.720 --> 23:29.640
I think I've already caught it.

408
23:35.640 --> 23:38.040
You're still caring about me at this point.

409
23:39.740 --> 23:41.180
I'm so moved.

410
23:41.510 --> 23:42.440
What do you mean?

411
23:42.830 --> 23:44.960
Shouldn't you be more concerned about

412
23:44.980 --> 23:45.740
when Fu Shize

413
23:45.740 --> 23:47.010
is coming back?

414
23:48.240 --> 23:50.290
He's coming back next Monday.

415
23:55.310 --> 23:56.910
Even with my nose stuffed up,

416
23:56.940 --> 23:58.140
I can still

417
23:58.140 --> 24:00.670
smell something special permeating the air.

418
24:01.830 --> 24:02.770
What is it?

419
24:05.780 --> 24:07.600
The smell of missing someone.

420
24:11.380 --> 24:12.220
I won't argue with you

421
24:12.220 --> 24:13.950
since you're having a cold now.

422
24:18.110 --> 24:18.980
Oh, right.

423
24:20.680 --> 24:22.070
Fu Shize might come back

424
24:22.070 --> 24:23.530
in time for the first snow.

425
24:24.080 --> 24:24.840
This will be

426
24:24.870 --> 24:27.130
the first time you two see snow together.

427
24:27.180 --> 24:28.270
Have you heard that

428
24:28.420 --> 24:30.420
couples who see the first snow together

429
24:30.420 --> 24:31.880
will be together forever?

430
24:33.010 --> 24:35.380
Walking through the falling snow

431
24:36.810 --> 24:37.570
is like

432
24:37.570 --> 24:39.970
having grey hair and growing old together.

433
24:56.820 --> 24:57.630
Tangy,

434
24:57.880 --> 25:00.030
are you looking forward to it for me

435
25:00.030 --> 25:02.070
or for yourself?

436
25:02.770 --> 25:04.310
For you, of course!

437
25:06.420 --> 25:08.080
Next Monday is New Year's Eve.

438
25:08.080 --> 25:08.880
Compared to the first snow,

439
25:08.880 --> 25:10.510
I'm looking forward to New Year's Eve more.

440
25:10.510 --> 25:12.310
It's so lively on New Year's Eve.

441
25:12.830 --> 25:14.110
Who wants to see the snow

442
25:14.110 --> 25:15.240
with you lovebirds?

443
25:31.720 --> 25:33.440
I'm missing him so much.

444
25:34.810 --> 25:36.740
But he doesn't seem to miss me much.

445
25:40.310 --> 25:41.880
We are already dating.

446
25:43.010 --> 25:45.340
Why does it still feel like a secret crush?

447
25:54.510 --> 25:56.440
Why the sudden video call?

448
25:57.510 --> 25:58.330
Ready for bed?

449
25:58.980 --> 25:59.770
Nope.

450
26:00.870 --> 26:02.870
Why are you just having dinner now?

451
26:04.920 --> 26:06.540
There was a technical issue earlier

452
26:06.540 --> 26:08.140
that the other party couldn't solve.

453
26:08.140 --> 26:09.330
I just finished talking with them.

454
26:09.330 --> 26:11.220
You guys still need to pay attention to it.

455
26:11.220 --> 26:12.680
It's bad for your stomach.

456
26:13.010 --> 26:14.270
And drink less coffee, too.

457
26:14.270 --> 26:14.850
Mm.

458
26:15.940 --> 26:16.480
By the way,

459
26:16.480 --> 26:17.940
when are you coming back?

460
26:18.720 --> 26:19.510
Next Monday.

461
26:21.980 --> 26:23.580
It's gotten colder in Nanwu.

462
26:23.610 --> 26:25.420
It might snow on Monday.

463
26:26.030 --> 26:26.830
Is that so?

464
26:28.340 --> 26:29.610
Then remember to wrap up warm,

465
26:29.610 --> 26:30.680
in case you catch a cold.

466
26:30.680 --> 26:31.350
Mm.

467
26:32.540 --> 26:34.700
I haven't seen snow before.

468
26:35.770 --> 26:36.570
Really?

469
26:37.110 --> 26:37.790
Yeah.

470
26:37.980 --> 26:39.220
This might be my first time

471
26:39.220 --> 26:40.240
seeing snow.

472
26:45.880 --> 26:47.020
Then you should...

473
26:47.770 --> 26:48.570
What?

474
26:50.030 --> 26:52.090
Mind your step on the slippery roads.

475
26:54.510 --> 26:55.310
I got it.

476
27:00.580 --> 27:03.000
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

477
27:05.680 --> 27:07.610
[Schedule Reminder: Fu Shize's flight departed]

478
27:26.030 --> 27:26.960
Wake up, wake up.

479
28:18.050 --> 28:19.440
What a pity.

480
28:20.090 --> 28:22.290
Why couldn't it have snowed a bit later?

481
28:22.510 --> 28:23.700
I wanted to see the snow

482
28:23.700 --> 28:24.680
with Fu Shize.

483
28:34.860 --> 28:37.310
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

484
28:37.340 --> 28:39.970
♪ Through ceaseless tides that ebb and flow ♪

485
28:41.700 --> 28:44.200
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

486
28:43.500 --> 28:44.250
Yun Lili.

487
28:44.220 --> 28:47.610
♪ As we feel the changes of seasons ♪

488
28:48.190 --> 28:51.760
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

489
28:51.930 --> 28:54.790
♪ To meet the moon ♪

490
28:54.820 --> 28:57.500
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

491
28:57.520 --> 29:00.660
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

492
29:00.830 --> 29:04.990
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

493
29:05.170 --> 29:08.040
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

494
29:08.150 --> 29:11.890
♪ Love gives us all ♪

495
29:11.900 --> 29:13.220
You're back? Why?

496
29:11.910 --> 29:14.970
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

497
29:14.990 --> 29:15.810
♪ You know ♪

498
29:15.830 --> 29:19.070
♪ I'm in love with you ♪

499
29:19.090 --> 29:21.900
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

500
29:21.010 --> 29:22.070
You wanted to see the first snow,

501
29:21.920 --> 29:25.500
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

502
29:22.570 --> 29:23.680
so I came back.

503
29:25.310 --> 29:27.160
I was just about to go to the airport to pick you up.

504
29:26.400 --> 29:31.300
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

505
29:29.200 --> 29:30.860
I took an earlier flight back.

506
29:31.090 --> 29:32.420
Perfect timing, right?

507
29:33.610 --> 29:34.220
Mm.

508
29:35.240 --> 29:36.110
Are you sleepy?

509
29:36.110 --> 29:38.240
Do you want to go home and get some rest?

510
29:43.010 --> 29:44.250
I was quite sleepy.

511
29:45.420 --> 29:46.880
But I'm fully charged now.

512
29:47.200 --> 29:48.000
Now?

513
29:49.460 --> 29:50.090
Mm.

514
29:53.640 --> 29:55.220
I'm recharging now.

515
30:07.110 --> 30:08.000
Welcome home.

516
30:08.310 --> 30:09.770
You've worked hard today.

517
30:09.980 --> 30:11.310
Have a good rest at home.

518
30:11.330 --> 30:13.140
Hope you have a lovely day!

519
30:14.350 --> 30:15.080
Give it to me.

520
30:32.460 --> 30:34.120
You haven't seen snow before?

521
30:34.290 --> 30:34.860
Nope.

522
30:35.380 --> 30:36.790
It never snows in Xifu.

523
30:37.830 --> 30:39.090
This is my first time

524
30:39.090 --> 30:40.250
seeing snow,

525
30:41.310 --> 30:42.310
and it's with you.

526
30:46.440 --> 30:47.680
Then I'm very lucky.

527
30:53.200 --> 30:54.110
Fu Shize.

528
30:55.830 --> 30:57.350
Thank you for liking me.

529
31:09.290 --> 31:11.000
♪ It's you ♪

530
31:11.090 --> 31:13.300
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

531
31:13.330 --> 31:14.490
♪ Just you ♪

532
31:14.510 --> 31:17.170
♪ Are the instinct I can't quit ♪

533
31:17.270 --> 31:18.650
♪ It's always you ♪

534
31:18.680 --> 31:21.000
♪ Bringing faded colors back to life ♪

535
31:21.020 --> 31:24.290
♪ And keeping me company through the endless night ♪

536
31:24.980 --> 31:26.350
♪ It's you ♪

537
31:26.370 --> 31:28.350
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

538
31:28.370 --> 31:29.600
♪ Just you ♪

539
31:29.620 --> 31:32.600
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

540
31:32.620 --> 31:33.570
♪ It's always you ♪

541
31:33.590 --> 31:34.670
♪ Even the most ♪

542
31:34.690 --> 31:37.380
♪ Ordinary seasons feel warm again ♪

543
31:38.250 --> 31:41.130
♪ It's you ♪

544
31:39.210 --> 31:42.870
[Weather Forecast]

545
31:57.350 --> 31:57.900
Tang Lin!

546
31:58.810 --> 32:00.330
A friend of mine wants to see you.

547
32:00.330 --> 32:01.510
Who?

548
32:01.740 --> 32:03.340
You'll know when you see him.

549
32:03.590 --> 32:04.310
It's freezing cold.

550
32:04.310 --> 32:05.910
Can't you let your friend in?

551
32:06.550 --> 32:08.110
If this friend of mine comes inside,

552
32:08.110 --> 32:09.000
he might cry.

553
32:09.180 --> 32:11.040
What even is this gibberish?

554
32:11.220 --> 32:11.960
It's cold outside.

555
32:11.960 --> 32:13.090
I'll put this on you.

556
32:22.010 --> 32:22.660
Alright.

557
32:27.770 --> 32:28.300
Let's go.

558
32:49.090 --> 32:49.610
Look,

559
32:49.770 --> 32:50.640
as I told you,

560
32:50.640 --> 32:52.030
if my friend goes inside,

561
32:52.030 --> 32:52.720
he will cry.

562
32:53.720 --> 32:56.180
So this is the friend you were talking about?

563
32:56.270 --> 32:58.130
Made up a "friend" out of nowhere.

564
33:00.330 --> 33:01.260
What did you say?

565
33:08.500 --> 33:09.330
My friend said that

566
33:09.330 --> 33:10.900
he had something to tell you.

567
33:10.900 --> 33:11.380
Come on.

568
33:11.660 --> 33:12.520
Come over here.

569
33:23.140 --> 33:24.400
My friend said

570
33:24.400 --> 33:25.660
he liked your hairpin.

571
33:27.410 --> 33:28.410
Childish.

572
33:38.500 --> 33:40.160
Which side should we put it on?

573
33:49.290 --> 33:50.020
Looks great.

574
33:53.940 --> 33:54.730
Hold on.

575
33:56.700 --> 33:58.640
My friend has a question for you.

576
34:01.440 --> 34:03.010
He asked

577
34:03.310 --> 34:03.900
if you'd like

578
34:03.900 --> 34:05.700
to be Fu Zhengchu's girlfriend.

579
34:12.610 --> 34:13.400
I...

580
34:31.780 --> 34:32.580
Wait a minute.

581
34:35.710 --> 34:37.090
Should I close my eyes

582
34:38.409 --> 34:39.889
when kissing?

583
35:08.240 --> 35:09.360
Hello, Tangy.

584
35:10.500 --> 35:11.690
Sorry,

585
35:11.820 --> 35:14.220
I can't spend New Year's Eve with you today.

586
35:15.000 --> 35:16.050
I knew it!

587
35:16.690 --> 35:17.900
You've ditched your friend for a guy.

588
35:17.900 --> 35:18.550
You got a boyfriend

589
35:18.550 --> 35:20.190
and forgot all about your bestie.

590
35:20.190 --> 35:21.920
How are you going to spend today, then?

591
35:21.920 --> 35:24.250
Should I go back early to keep you company?

592
35:24.260 --> 35:25.050
No, don't bother.

593
35:25.050 --> 35:25.690
Just enjoy

594
35:25.690 --> 35:26.820
your time together.

595
35:26.920 --> 35:28.120
Don't worry about me.

596
35:28.800 --> 35:30.400
Are you going to celebrate New Year's Eve

597
35:30.400 --> 35:31.420
with Fu Zhengchu?

598
35:32.630 --> 35:33.630
Of course not!

599
35:35.260 --> 35:36.210
Even if I spend it alone,

600
35:36.210 --> 35:37.300
I won't be with him.

601
35:37.710 --> 35:39.170
Besides, I still have Xia.

602
35:40.900 --> 35:41.860
I need to hang up.

603
35:41.860 --> 35:42.400
Bye-bye.

604
35:44.110 --> 35:44.860
Jiameng.

605
35:45.140 --> 35:46.320
I've finished

606
35:46.320 --> 35:47.110
the New Year posters

607
35:47.110 --> 35:47.650
and delivered them

608
35:47.650 --> 35:48.820
to all the departments.

609
35:48.820 --> 35:49.920
The ones for the experience center

610
35:49.920 --> 35:51.000
are on my office desk.

611
35:51.000 --> 35:51.760
Okay,

612
35:51.860 --> 35:52.820
I'll get someone to put them up

613
35:52.820 --> 35:54.620
at the experience center later.

614
35:55.780 --> 35:56.780
By the way, Yun Li,

615
35:57.000 --> 35:58.690
do you want to join us for dinner tonight?

616
35:58.690 --> 36:00.650
We'll go karaoke after dinner.

617
36:00.860 --> 36:01.800
Let's celebrate

618
36:01.800 --> 36:03.860
New Year's Eve and have fun together.

619
36:04.710 --> 36:06.500
I'll pass.

620
36:07.090 --> 36:09.000
I have a date with my boyfriend.

621
36:10.500 --> 36:11.730
You have a boyfriend?

622
36:12.190 --> 36:12.980
Who is it?

623
36:13.190 --> 36:14.110
Is he handsome?

624
36:14.460 --> 36:15.660
Is he your classmate?

625
36:16.500 --> 36:17.500
Not my classmate.

626
36:18.320 --> 36:19.380
It's my colleague.

627
36:20.310 --> 36:23.310
Is it Engineer Fu?

628
36:25.800 --> 36:27.500
Yes, I'm dating him.

629
36:27.760 --> 36:29.050
Since when?

630
36:29.190 --> 36:31.510
Just recently.

631
36:49.710 --> 36:51.420
Why is it so quiet today?

632
36:53.400 --> 36:54.330
It was too noisy.

633
36:56.300 --> 36:56.910
It's so cold

634
36:56.910 --> 36:58.710
that my face is almost freezing.

635
37:08.820 --> 37:09.680
Still cold now?

636
37:12.590 --> 37:13.570
Nope.

637
37:20.400 --> 37:21.710
You're very lucky today.

638
37:21.710 --> 37:23.210
As a food blogger,

639
37:23.210 --> 37:24.820
I'm going to show off

640
37:24.900 --> 37:26.320
my skills for you.

641
37:26.920 --> 37:29.000
Since when did you become a food blogger?

642
37:29.000 --> 37:30.190
I'm an all-round blogger.

643
37:30.190 --> 37:31.110
This is my new title.

644
37:31.110 --> 37:32.730
I'll change my bio when I get back.

645
37:32.730 --> 37:33.320
Fine.

646
37:33.420 --> 37:34.820
Today, I'll be assisting

647
37:34.900 --> 37:36.230
the all-round blogger.

648
38:18.400 --> 38:19.260
Are you cold?

649
39:46.410 --> 39:49.220
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

650
39:49.970 --> 39:52.620
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

651
39:53.420 --> 39:55.830
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

652
39:55.850 --> 39:59.050
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

653
39:59.960 --> 40:03.050
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

654
40:03.550 --> 40:05.710
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

655
40:05.970 --> 40:09.010
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

656
40:09.710 --> 40:13.010
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

657
40:14.580 --> 40:17.510
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

658
40:17.530 --> 40:19.690
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

659
40:21.570 --> 40:24.520
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

660
40:24.540 --> 40:26.830
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

661
40:27.910 --> 40:31.480
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

662
40:31.650 --> 40:34.510
♪ To meet the moon ♪

663
40:34.540 --> 40:37.470
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

664
40:37.490 --> 40:40.380
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

665
40:40.410 --> 40:44.570
♪ I just wanna stay with you ♪

666
40:45.140 --> 40:47.950
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

667
40:47.980 --> 40:51.560
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

668
40:52.450 --> 40:57.350
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪
